#. 朝日奈さんは…食堂の調査？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hina... Are you investigating the dining hall?"
msgstr ""

#. ううん、休憩中。
#. てか、ずっと休憩してるんだけどね。
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Oh, no. I'm just taking a break. Actually, I've been\n"
"taking a break since we started..."
msgstr ""

#. こんな経験初めてだからさ…
#. 何をどうしたらいいか、さっぱりで…
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"This is all a first for me, ya know? I don't have the\n"
"first clue what I should be doing."
msgstr ""

#. そうだよね…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I know what you mean..."
msgstr ""

#. それにさ、なんだかこの食堂って
#. 落ち着くんだよね。
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And I dunno why, but being in the dining hall helps\n"
"keep me calm."
msgstr ""

#. だから…ついつい居座っちゃうんだ…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So I know I shouldn't, but I've just been\n"
"kinda...hanging around here."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園ちゃんが殺された昨日の夜も…
#. そうだったし…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"To tell the truth...I was doing the same thing last\n"
"night, when Sayaka was killed..."
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、朝日奈さんは知らない？
#. 食堂の包丁が１本足りないみたいなんだけど…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hey, so...did you notice that one of the kitchen\n"
"knives is missing from the dining hall?"
msgstr ""

#. そうそう、私も変だと思ってたんだよね。
#. いつの間にか、包丁が無くなっててさ…
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, weird huh? I thought it was kinda strange, a\n"
"knife just suddenly disappearing like that."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、包丁は最初から足りなかった訳じゃないんだ？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, so it wasn't missing from the beginning?"
msgstr ""

#. 違うよ。前に見た時には、
#. ちゃんと全部揃ってたもん。
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Nope. Last I remember, they were all lined up in a\n"
"nice, neat row."
msgstr ""

#. 包丁がなくなったのに気付いたのは、いつの事？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So when did you notice one of them had disappeared?"
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の夜、紅茶を飲もうとして、
#. 厨房に入った時は、確かに包丁は揃ってたよ。
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Well, I went to go get some tea from the kitchen last\n"
"night, and all the knives were still there."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、食堂で紅茶を飲んだ後、
#. その紅茶を片づけようと厨房に入った時には…
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But when I finished my tea and went back into the\n"
"kitchen to wash my glass..."
msgstr ""

#. もうなかったんだ…
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...one of the knives was gone."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、朝日奈さんが食堂で紅茶を飲んでいる間に、
#. 包丁は消えちゃったんだね？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So you're saying the knife disappeared while you were\n"
"drinking your tea in the dining hall?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、包丁が持ち出されたのは、
#. 朝日奈さんが食堂にいる間だったんだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words, you were right there in the dining\n"
"hall when someone came and took it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、朝日奈さんは知ってるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then you should be able to say for sure...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その間、ボクが食堂に行ってないって事を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You can tell everyone I didn't come to the dining hall\n"
"last night...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、ボクが凶器を持ち出していないって事を！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which proves I didn't take it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>朝日奈の証言<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Aoi's Account<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、ところでさ…
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, by the way..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木って、本当に舞園ちゃんを殺しちゃったの？
msgctxt "0024 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Did you really kill Sayaka?"
msgstr ""

#. な、何言ってんだよ！　
#. そんな訳ないじゃないか！！
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What!? Of course not! I would never!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 朝日奈さんはボクが殺したって…思ってるの？
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hina...do you really think I murdered her?"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園ちゃんは苗木の部屋で殺されたんだよね？
#. だとしたら、やっぱり…
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Well...she was killed in your room, right? So I\n"
"mean..."
msgstr ""

#. でも…舞園ちゃんは苗木と仲良かったし、
#. そんな関係なのに殺人なんて…
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You guys were supposed to be friends, right? But you\n"
"still...killed her..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、仲良いからこそ殺人が起きるってのは
#. ドラマの定番でもあるし…
msgctxt "0030 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"On the other hand, two people becoming good friends,\n"
"then one killing the other is a classic drama setup."
msgstr ""

#. とか、全部ひっくるめて考えると…
msgctxt "0031 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So when you consider everything together..."
msgstr ""

#. 結局…よくわかんないよ……
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...I honestly have no idea."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 学校エリアの…赤い扉…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The red door on the 1st floor..."
msgstr ""

#. そこに行けばいいんだな…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's where I should go."
msgstr ""

#. …行くしかないんだな。
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...No, where I *have* to go."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなモニターなんて…
#. 気にしてる場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't waste time worrying about these monitors...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 忘れよう。記憶から抹消しよう。
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Forget it. I need to just erase it from my memory."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この監視カメラで…
#. ボクらが捜査してる姿を見てるって言うのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whoever's behind this must be using these cameras to\n"
"observe our investigation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな事させて…
#. 一体何が目的なんだよ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To force us into a situation like this... What the\n"
"hell do they want from us!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>捜査に制限時間はあるのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder if there's a time limit on the\n"
"investigation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく、急いだ方が良さそうだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, doesn't matter. Either way I need to move as\n"
"fast as I can.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0043 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0044 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
